<main class="mx-auto mt-8 w-full max-w-5xl px-4 pb-10 text-[#344E41] sm:px-6">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
    <section class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-white/80 p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-[#344E41]/10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#344E41]">Profile</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[#344E41]/75">Informasi akun dan ringkasan progress.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-[#344E41]/60">Nama</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-[#344E41]"><%= user.name %></p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-[#344E41]/60">Email</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-[#344E41]"><%= user.email %></p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-[#344E41]/60">XP</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-[#588157]"><%= profile.xp %></p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-[#344E41]/60">Level / Streak</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-[#588157]"><%= profile.level %> / <%= profile.streak %></p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4 sm:col-span-2">
          <p class="text-sm text-[#344E41]/60">Longest Streak</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-[#588157]"><%= profile.longestStreak %> hari</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#A3B18A]/40 bg-[#FFFDF8] p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-[#344E41]/10">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#B7792D]">Pengingat Salat</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-[#344E41]">Pengaturan Adzan</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/72">
            Popup waktu salat tetap muncul di dashboard. Pengaturan ini mengatur apakah aplikasi memutar suara, suara browser, atau hanya popup.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="grid h-12 w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#D4A373]/16 text-[#B7792D]">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v2.5c0 .9.3 1.7.9 2.3l.8.8c.4.4.1 1.1-.5 1.1H5.8c-.6 0-.9-.7-.5-1.1l.8-.8c.6-.6.9-1.4.9-2.3V8a5 5 0 0 1 5-5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M9.5 18a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 5 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <form action="/profile/adhan-settings" method="post" class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <label class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#D8CDBB] bg-[#F6F1E9] p-4">
          <input
            type="checkbox"
            name="enabled"
            class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 rounded border-[#A3B18A] text-[#4F7F53] focus:ring-[#4F7F53]"
            <%= adhanSettings.enabled ? "checked" : "" %>
          />
          <span>
            <span class="block text-base font-bold text-[#344E41]">Aktifkan suara otomatis</span>
            <span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/68">
              Saat waktu salat masuk, aplikasi akan mencoba memutar suara sesuai pilihan di bawah. Jika browser menahan autoplay, popup tetap muncul dan tombol manual tetap tersedia.
            </span>
          </span>
        </label>

        <div>
          <label for="soundKey" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#588157]">Pilihan Suara</label>
          <select
            id="soundKey"
            name="soundKey"
            class="mt-3 w-full rounded-[1.25rem] border border-[#D8CDBB] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#344E41] outline-none transition focus:border-[#4F7F53]"
          >
            <% adhanSoundOptions.forEach((option) => { %>
              <option value="<%= option.key %>" <%= adhanSettings.soundKey === option.key ? "selected" : "" %>>
                <%= option.label %>
              </option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3">
            <% adhanSoundOptions.forEach((option) => { %>
              <article class="rounded-[1.25rem] border border-[#E4DCCD] bg-white px-4 py-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                  <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#344E41]"><%= option.label %></p>
                  <span class="rounded-full bg-[#F6F1E9] px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B7792D]"><%= option.sourceLabel %></span>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/66"><%= option.description %></p>
              </article>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <label for="volume" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#588157]">Volume</label>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#F6F1E9] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#344E41]"><%= adhanSettings.volume %>%</span>
          </div>
          <input
            id="volume"
            type="range"
            name="volume"
            min="0"
            max="100"
            value="<%= adhanSettings.volume %>"
            class="mt-4 h-2 w-full cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-full bg-[#D8CDBB]"
          />
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#344E41]/62">Volume hanya dipakai untuk opsi audio online. Mode browser voice mengikuti volume perangkat dan browser.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#D8CDBB] bg-[#FBF7EF] px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/68">
          Sumber audio online saat ini memakai koleksi publik dari Wikimedia Commons. Kalau nanti kamu mau, setting ini bisa dilanjutkan ke preferensi permanen per akun di database.
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#4F7F53] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#D4A373] hover:text-[#244338]"
        >
          Simpan Pengaturan
        </button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
